       Identification Division.                                         00010031
       Program-ID. F115ICU0.                                            00020031
       Author.  Nina Dahl Larsen.                                       00030031
      *################################################################*00040031
      *                                                                 00050031
      * FD International Services                                       00060031
      *                                                                 00070031
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Customer.         00080031
      *                                                                 00090031
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00100031
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified.               00110031
      *                                                                 00120031
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00130031
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00140031
      *                                                                 00150031
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00160031
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00170031
      *      See seperate description below.                            00180031
      *                                                                 00190031
      *                                                                 00200031
      * An ordinary call may look like this:                            00210031
      *                                                                 00220031
      *    Initialize                          R115ICU0-Customer        00230031
      *    Set   R115ICU0-Version        To    True                     00240031
      *    Set   R115ICU0-In-Select      To    True                     00250031
      *                                                                 00260031
      *    Move  &fin-inst-id            To    R115iCU0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  00270031
      *    Move  &customer-id            To    R115iCU0-In-Customer-ID  00280031
      *                                                                 00290031
      *    Call  'F115ICU0'              Using R115ICU0-Customer        00300031
      *                                        R7919999-Error           00310031
      *    End-Call                                                     00320031
      *                                                                 00330031
      *    Evaluate True                                                00340031
      *      When R7919999-Retur-Abend                                  00350031
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        00360031
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00370031
      *                                                                 00380031
      *      When R7919999-Retur-Feil                                   00390031
      *        ...not found...                                          00400031
      *                                                                 00410031
      *      When R7919999-Retur-OK                                     00420031
      *        ...found...                                              00430031
      *                                                                 00440031
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00450031
      *                                                                 00460031
      *################################################################*00470031
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00480031
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00490031
      *071211!NDL! New  Cursor,  all                             !LT12! 00500033
      *160101!NDL! New module                                    !LT12! 00501033
      *################################################################*00510031
       Environment Division.                                            00520031
       Configuration Section.                                           00530031
       Special-Names.                                                   00540031
           Decimal-Point Is Comma.                                      00550031
      *                                                                 00560031
      *################################################################*00570031
       Data Division.                                                   00580031
       Working-Storage Section.                                         00590031
      *                                                                 00600031
       01  Filler.                                                      00610031
      *                                                                 00620031
           05  W-Table-Name              Pic  X(18) Value               00630031
                                                   'TF_Customer     '.  00640031
      *                                                                 00650031
           05  W-IO-Length               Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00660031
      *                                                                 00670031
           05  WD-Length                 Pic  Z.ZZ9.                    00680031
           05  WD-SQLCode                Pic -9(03).                    00690031
      *                                                                 00700031
           05  Ind-WS-Put                Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00710031
           05  Ind-WS                    Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00720031
           05  W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab          Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00730031
      *                                                                 00740031
           05  Filler.                                                  00750031
               10  WD-Fin-Inst-ID        Pic  zzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz9.       00760031
               10  WD-Customer-No        Pic  99999999999.              00770031
      *                                                                 00780031
      *                                                                 00790031
           05  W-Max-Navn                Pic  X(35).                    00800031
           05  Filler REDEFINES W-Max-Navn.                             00810031
                 10  Navn-Char           Pic X(01)   Occurs 35.         00820031
           05  W-Ind                     Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00830031
      *                                                                 00840031
           05  Filler.                                                  00850031
               10  W-Fin-Inst-No         Pic  X(18).                    00860031
               10  W-Fin-Inst-ID         Pic  9(18)              Comp-3.00870031
               10  W-Customer-No         Pic  9(11)              Comp-3.00880031
               10  W-Customer-ID         Pic  9(11)              Comp-3.00890031
      *                                                                 00900031
           05  W-Input-Action            Pic  X(10).                    00910031
             88  SW-IA-Initialize                   Value 'INITIALIZE'. 00920031
      *                                                                 00930031
      *    This field is needed because of the old interfaces used to   00940031
      *    access Fin-Inst-ID and Customer ID.                          00950031
           05  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr          Pic  9(04).                    00960031
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*00970031
      * Counters, used on cursor read, to return row no. and total      00980031
      * no. of rows.                                                    00990031
      * Total no. of rows is only returned when -In-Count is set on     01000031
      * the Get-1st-call.                                               01010031
      *                                                                 01020031
           05  WC-Counters.                                             01030031
               10  WC-Row-No             Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.01040031
               10  WC-Total-No-Of-Rows   Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.01050031
      *                                                                 01060031
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01070031
      * Switches used for selecting the correct cursor:                 01080031
      *                                                                 01090031
           05  SW-Cursor-Code.                                          01100031
               10  SW-CC-Fin-Inst        Pic  X(01).                    01110031
                 88  Sw-Use-Fin-Inst                Value 'F'.          01120031
               10  SW-CC-Bank            Pic  X(01).                    01130031
                 88  Sw-Use-Bic-Bank                Value 'B'.          01140031
               10  SW-CC-Country         Pic  X(01).                    01150031
                 88  Sw-Use-Bic-Country             Value 'C'.          01160031
               10  SW-CC-Location        Pic  X(01).                    01170031
                 88  Sw-Use-Bic-Location            Value 'L'.          01180031
               10  SW-CC-Branch          Pic  X(01).                    01190031
                 88  Sw-Use-Bic-Branch              Value 'R'.          01200031
               10  SW-CC-Surname         Pic  X(01).                    01210031
                 88  Sw-Use-Surname                 Value 'S'.          01220031
               10  SW-CC-Countrycode     Pic  X(01).                    01230031
                 88  Sw-Use-Countrycode             Value 'O'.          01240031
      *                                                                 01250031
           05  Filler                    Redefines SW-Cursor-Code       01260031
                                         Pic  X(07).                    01270031
             88  Sw-Use-Fi-Asc                      Value 'F      '.    01281032
             88  Sw-Use-Fi-Ba-Asc                   Value 'FB     '.    01290031
             88  Sw-Use-Fi-Ba-CC-Asc                Value 'FBC    '.    01300031
             88  Sw-Use-Fi-Ba-CC-Lo-Asc             Value 'FBCL   '.    01310031
             88  Sw-Use-Fi-Ba-CC-Lo-Br-A            Value 'FBCLR  '.    01320031
             88  Sw-Use-Fi-Su-Asc                   Value 'F    S '.    01330031
             88  Sw-Use-Fi-Co-Asc                   Value 'F     O'.    01340031
             88  Sw-Use-Fi-Su-Co-Asc                Value 'F    SO'.    01350031
             88  Sw-Use-All                         Value '       '.    01351033
      *                                                                 01360031
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01370031
      * These fields are used for SQL qualification:                    01380031
      *                                                                 01390031
           05  W-DB-Key.                                                01400031
               10  W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID      Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01410031
               10  W-DB-Customer-ID      Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.01420031
               10  W-DB-From-Name        Pic  X(15).                    01430031
               10  W-DB-To-Name          Pic  X(15).                    01440031
               10  W-DB-Country-Code     Pic  X(02).                    01450031
               10  W-DB-Bic-Code         Pic  X(11).                    01460031
      *                                                                 01470031
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01480031
      * These fields are used for comparison with the WS-fields.        01490031
      *                                                                 01500031
           05  WE-Cursor-Info.                                          01510031
             07  WE-Key.                                                01520031
               10  WE-Fin-Inst-ID        Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01530031
               10  WE-Fin-Inst-No        Pic  X(18).                    01540031
               10  WE-Customer-ID        Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.01550031
               10  WE-Customer-No        Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.01560031
               10  WE-From-Name          Pic  X(15).                    01570031
               10  WE-To-Name            Pic  X(15).                    01580031
               10  WE-Country-Code       Pic  X(02).                    01590031
               10  WE-Bic-Code           Pic  X(11).                    01600031
             07  WE-Code-Sequence        Pic  X(01).                    01610031
               88  WE-CS-Ascending                  Value 'A'.          01620031
               88  WE-CS-Descending                 Value 'D'.          01630031
      *                                                                 01640031
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01650031
      * Storage, and switches for identifying the content:              01660031
      * The cursor info is used to verify that the get-next has the     01670031
      * same qualification as the get-1st.                              01680031
      *                                                                 01690031
       01  W-Storage.                                                   01700031
      *                                                                 01710031
           05  WS-Cursor-Info.                                          01720031
             07  WS-Key.                                                01730031
               10  WS-Fin-Inst-ID        Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01740031
               10  WS-Fin-Inst-No        Pic  X(18).                    01750031
               10  WS-Customer-ID        Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.01760031
               10  WS-Customer-No        Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.01770031
               10  WS-From-Name          Pic  X(15).                    01780031
               10  WS-To-Name            Pic  X(15).                    01790031
               10  WS-Country-Code       Pic  X(02).                    01800031
               10  WS-Bic-Code           Pic  X(11).                    01810031
             07  WS-Code-Sequence        Pic  X(01).                    01820031
               88  WS-CS-Ascending                  Value 'A'.          01830031
               88  WS-CS-Descending                 Value 'D'.          01840031
             07  WS-Cursor-Status        Pic  X(08).                    01850031
               88  WS-Cursor-OK                     Value 'OK'.         01860031
               88  WS-Cursor-End                    Value 'END'.        01870031
      *                                                                 01880031
      * We store all occurences that are read, also those that we do    01890031
      * not find. This is to reduce the number of DB2 accesses.         01900031
      *                                                                 01910031
           05  WS-DB2-Table.                                            01920031
             07  WS-DB2-Row              Occurs 10 Times.               01930031
               10  WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID    Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01940031
               10  WS-DB2-Customer-Id    Pic s9(11)              Comp-3.01950031
               10  WS-DB2-Code           Pic S9(01)              Comp-3.01960031
                 88  WS-DB2-Not-Read                Value +0.           01970031
                 88  WS-DB2-Read                    Value +1.           01980031
                 88  WS-DB2-Not-Found               Value +2.           01990031
               10  WS-DB2-DCL            Pic  X(350).                   02000031
      *                                                                 02010031
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*02020031
      * Areas for use when accessing DB2.                               02030031
      *                                                                 02040031
           Exec SQL Include R115TFCU End-Exec.                          02050031
      *                                                                 02060031
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*02070031
      * Internal area:                                                  02080031
      *                                                                 02090031
       01  W-Int-IO-Area.                                               02100031
           Copy R115ICU0.                                               02110031
      *                                                                 02120031
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*02130031
      * Assorted copy-areas:                                            02140031
      *                                                                 02150031
       01  Filler.                                                      02160031
           Copy R115ICUS.                                               02170031
      *                                                                 02180031
       01  Filler.                                                      02190031
           Copy R1781910.                                               02200031
      *                                                                 02210031
       01  Filler.                                                      02220031
           Copy R5879010.                                               02230031
      *                                                                 02240031
       01  Filler.                                                      02250031
           Copy R7918030.                                               02260031
      *                                                                 02270031
       Copy R7919100.                                                   02280031
       Copy R115X000.                                                   02290031
      *COPY R115L990.                                                   02300031
      *                                                                 02310031
      *################################################################.02320031
       Linkage Section.                                                 02330031
      *                                                                 02340031
       01  L-Ext-IO-Area                 Pic  X(560).                   02350031
       Copy R7919999.                                                   02360031
      *                                                                 02370031
      *################################################################.02380031
       Procedure Division                Using L-Ext-IO-Area            02390031
                                               R7919999-Error-Area.     02400031
      *                                                                 02410031
       A000-Main                         Section.                       02420031
      *                                                                 02430031
           Perform B000-Initialize                                      02440031
      *                                                                 02450031
           Evaluate True                                                02460031
             When SW-IA-Initialize                                      02470031
               Continue                                                 02480031
      *                                                                 02490031
             When Other                                                 02500031
               Perform ZI00-Conv-Input-Version                          02510031
               Perform C000-Interface                                   02520031
               Perform ZO00-Conv-Output-Version                         02530031
      *                                                                 02540031
           End-Evaluate                                                 02550031
      *                                                                 02560031
           Goback.                                                      02570031
      *################################################################*02580031
       B000-Initialize                   Section.                       02590031
      *                                                                 02600031
           Set   R7919999-Return-OK      To    True                     02610031
      *                                                                 02620031
           Evaluate True                                                02630031
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:10)   =     'INITIALIZE'             02640031
               Set   Sw-IA-Initialize    To    True                     02650031
             When Other                                                 02660031
               Move  Space               To    W-Input-Action           02670031
           End-Evaluate                                                 02680031
      *                                                                 02690031
           Compute  W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab                                    02700031
               =    Length               Of    WS-DB2-Table             02710031
               /    Length               Of    WS-DB2-Row               02720031
      *                                                                 02730031
           If  Sw-IA-Initialize                                         02740031
           or  WS-DB2-Code (1)           Not   Numeric                  02750031
               Initialize                      W-Storage                02760031
               Move  +0                  To    Ind-WS-Put               02770031
           End-If                                                       02780031
      *                                                                 02790031
           If  WC-Row-No                 Not   Numeric                  02800031
           or  WC-Total-No-Of-Rows       Not   Numeric                  02810031
               Initialize                      WC-Counters              02820031
           End-If                                                       02830031
      *                                                                 02840031
           .                                                            02850031
      *################################################################.02860031
       C000-Interface                    Section.                       02870031
      *                                                                 02880031
           Evaluate True                                                02890031
             When R115ICU0-In-Get-1st                                   02900031
               Perform C100-Initialize-Output                           02910031
               Perform D000-Get-1st                                     02920031
               Perform E000-Get-Next                                    02930031
      *                                                                 02940031
             When R115ICU0-In-Get-Next                                  02950031
               Perform C100-Initialize-Output                           02960031
               Perform E000-Get-Next                                    02970031
      *                                                                 02980031
             When R115ICU0-In-Select                                    02990031
               Perform C100-Initialize-Output                           03000031
               Perform F000-Select                                      03010031
      *                                                                 03020031
             When R115ICU0-In-Insert                                    03030031
               Perform G000-Insert                                      03040031
      *                                                                 03050031
             When R115ICU0-In-Update                                    03060031
               Perform H000-Update                                      03070031
      *                                                                 03080031
             When R115ICU0-In-Delete                                    03090031
               Perform I000-Delete                                      03100031
      *                                                                 03110031
             When Other                                                 03120031
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    03130031
               Move  'GL-IN-AKSJON-UV'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  03140031
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)03150031
               Move  R115ICU0-In-Action  To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)03160031
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               03170031
               Move  'C001'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       03180031
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       03190031
      *                                                                 03200031
           End-Evaluate                                                 03210031
      *                                                                 03220031
           .                                                            03230031
      *################################################################.03240031
       C100-Initialize-Output            Section.                       03250031
      *                                                                 03260031
           Initialize                          R115ICU0-Data            03270031
      *                                                                 03280031
           .                                                            03290031
      *################################################################.03300031
       D000-Get-1st                      Section.                       03310031
      *                                                                 03320031
           Perform D100-Prepare-Input                                   03330031
           Perform D200-Prepare-Qualification                           03340031
           Perform D300-Select-Cursor                                   03350031
           If  R115ICU0-In-CC-Count                                     03360031
               Perform D400-Count-Cursor                                03370031
           End-If                                                       03380031
           Perform D500-Open-Cursor                                     03390031
      *                                                                 03400031
           .                                                            03410031
      *################################################################.03420031
       D100-Prepare-Input                Section.                       03430031
      *                                                                 03440031
      * We create internal from- and to-values, depending on the input. 03450031
      *                                                                 03460031
           Initialize                          WE-Cursor-Info           03470031
      *                                                                 03480031
           Move  R115iCU0-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    WE-Fin-Inst-ID           03490031
           Move  R115iCU0-In-Fin-Inst-No To    WE-Fin-Inst-No           03500031
      *                                                                 03510031
           Move  R115iCU0-In-Customer-ID To    WE-Customer-ID           03520031
           Move  R115iCU0-In-Customer-No To    WE-Customer-No           03530031
      *                                                                 03540031
           Move  R115ICU0-In-Bic-Code    To    WE-Bic-Code              03550031
           Inspect WE-Bic-Code           Converting '* ' To '%%'        03560031
      *                                                                 03570031
           Move  R115ICU0-In-ID-Surname  To    WE-From-Name             03580031
      *    Inspect WE-From-Name          Converting '* ' To '%%'        03590031
      *                                                                 03600031
           Move  R115ICU0-In-Country-Code To    WE-Country-Code         03610031
      *    Inspect WE-Country-Code       Converting '* ' To '%%'        03620031
      *                                                                 03630031
           .                                                            03640031
      *################################################################.03650031
       D200-Prepare-Qualification        Section.                       03660031
      *                                                                 03670031
      * We store the qualification, so that we can check that the       03680031
      * qualification do not change on any following Get-Next.          03690031
      *                                                                 03700031
           Initialize                          WS-Cursor-Info           03710031
           Move  WE-Key                  To    WS-Key                   03720031
           Move  WE-Code-Sequence        To    WS-Code-Sequence         03730031
      *                                                                 03740031
           Initialize WC-Counters                                       03750031
      *                                                                 03760031
      * We fill in the SQL host variables.                              03770031
      *                                                                 03780031
           Initialize                          W-DB-Key                 03790031
      *                                                                 03800031
           Move  WS-Bic-Code             To    W-DB-Bic-Code            03810031
           Move  WS-Country-Code         To    W-DB-Country-Code        03820031
      *                                                                 03830031
      *    Move  WS-ID-Surname           To    W-DB-ID-Surname          03840031
           Move  WE-From-Name            To    W-Max-Navn               03850031
                                               W-DB-From-Name           03860031
           Move Length of WE-From-Name   To    W-Ind                    03870031
           Perform N500-Navn-Intervall                                  03880031
           Move  W-Max-Navn              To    W-DB-To-Name             03890031
      *                                                                 03900031
           Move  WE-Fin-Inst-ID          To    W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID         03910031
           Move  WE-Customer-ID          To    W-DB-Customer-ID         03920031
      *                                                                 03930031
           If  WE-Fin-Inst-No            Not = Space                    03940031
           and W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID          =     +0                       03950031
               Move  WE-Fin-Inst-No      To    W-Fin-Inst-No            03960031
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           03970031
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID         03980031
           End-If                                                       03990031
      *                                                                 04000031
           If  WE-Customer-No            Not = +0                       04010031
           and W-DB-Customer-ID          =     +0                       04020031
               Move  WE-Fin-Inst-No      To    W-Fin-Inst-No            04030031
               Move  WE-Fin-Inst-ID      To    W-Fin-Inst-ID            04040031
               Move  WE-Customer-No      To    W-Customer-No            04050031
               Perform N300-Fetch-Customer-ID                           04060031
               Move  W-Customer-ID       To    W-DB-Customer-ID         04070031
           End-If                                                       04080031
      *                                                                 04090031
      *                                                                 04100031
      * Check Country-Code ?????                                        04110031
      *                                                                 04120031
           .                                                            04130031
      *################################################################.04140031
       D300-Select-Cursor                Section.                       04150031
      *                                                                 04160031
      * We choose which cursor to use, depending on the qualification.  04170031
      *                                                                 04180031
           Move  Space                   To    SW-Cursor-Code           04190031
      *                                                                 04200031
           If  W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID          Not = +0                       04210031
               Set  Sw-Use-Fin-Inst      To    True                     04220031
           End-If                                                       04230031
      *                                                                 04240031
           If  W-DB-From-Name            Not = Space                    04250031
      *    and W-DB-ID-Surname (1:1)     Not = '%'                      04260031
               Set   SW-Use-Surname                                     04270031
                                         To    True                     04280031
           End-If                                                       04290031
      *                                                                 04300031
           If  W-DB-Country-Code         Not = Space                    04310031
               Set   SW-Use-CountryCode                                 04320031
                                         To    True                     04330031
           End-If                                                       04340031
      *                                                                 04350031
           If  W-DB-Bic-Code             Not = Space                    04360031
           and W-DB-Bic-Code (1:1)       Not = '%'                      04370031
               Set   SW-Use-Bic-Bank     To    True                     04380031
      *                                                                 04390031
               If  W-DB-Bic-Code(5:1)    Not = Space                    04400031
               and W-DB-Bic-Code (5:1)   Not = '%'                      04410031
                   Set   SW-Use-Bic-Country  To    True                 04420031
               End-If                                                   04430031
      *                                                                 04440031
               If  W-DB-Bic-Code(7:1)    Not = Space                    04450031
               and W-DB-Bic-Code(7:1)    Not = '%'                      04460031
                   Set   SW-Use-Bic-Location To    True                 04470031
               End-If                                                   04480031
      *                                                                 04490031
               If  W-DB-Bic-Code(9:1)    Not = Space                    04500031
               and W-DB-Bic-Code(9:1)    Not = '%'                      04510031
                   Set   SW-Use-Bic-Branch To    True                   04520031
               End-If                                                   04530031
      *                                                                 04540031
           End-If                                                       04550031
      *                                                                 04560031
           Evaluate True                                                04570031
             When Sw-Use-Fi-Asc                                         04580031
             or   Sw-Use-Fi-Ba-Asc                                      04590031
             or   Sw-Use-Fi-Ba-CC-Asc                                   04600031
             or   Sw-Use-Fi-Ba-CC-Lo-Asc                                04610031
             or   Sw-Use-Fi-Ba-CC-Lo-Br-A                               04620031
             or   Sw-Use-Fi-Su-Asc                                      04630031
             or   Sw-Use-Fi-Co-Asc                                      04640031
             or   Sw-Use-Fi-Su-Co-Asc                                   04650031
             or   Sw-Use-All                                            04651033
               Continue                                                 04660031
      *                                                                 04670031
             When other                                                 04680031
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    04690031
               Move  'GL-CURSOR-UV'      To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  04700031
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)04710031
               Move  SW-Cursor-Code      To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)04720031
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               04730031
               Move  'D302'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       04740031
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       04750031
      *                                                                 04760031
           End-Evaluate                                                 04770031
      *                                                                 04780031
           .                                                            04790031
      *################################################################.04800031
       D400-Count-Cursor                 Section.                       04810031
      *                                                                 04820031
           Initialize                          R115iCUS-SQL-Submodules  04830031
           Set   R115iCUS-Version        To    True                     04840031
           Set   R115iCUS-In-Count-Cursor                               04850031
                                         To    True                     04860031
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115iCUS-Cursor-Code     04870031
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115iCUS-DB-Key          04880031
