      *################################################################.05450031
       E100-Check-Qualification          Section.                       05460031
      *                                                                 05470031
      * We use the WE-fields for comparison with the WS-fields.         05480031
      * This to verify that the qualification has not changes since     05490031
      * the Get-1st.                                                    05500031
      *                                                                 05510031
           Evaluate True                                                05520031
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   05530031
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         05540031
             and  WS-Cursor-OK                                          05550031
               Continue                                                 05560031
      *                                                                 05570031
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   05580031
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         05590031
             and  WS-Cursor-End                                         05600031
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    05610031
               Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE'     To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  05620031
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)05630031
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)05640031
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               05650031
               Move  'E101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       05660031
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       05670031
      *                                                                 05680031
             When Other                                                 05690031
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    05700031
               Move  'GL-BRUK-GET-1ST'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  05710031
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               05720031
               Move  'E102'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       05730031
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       05740031
      *                                                                 05750031
           End-Evaluate                                                 05760031
      *                                                                 05770031
