             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    05950031
               Add   +1                  To    WC-Row-No                05960031
      *                                                                 05970031
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 05980031
               Set   WS-Cursor-End       To    True                     05990031
               If  WC-Row-No             =     +0                       06000031
                 Then                                                   06010031
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    06020031
                   Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF'                              06030031
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06040031
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06050031
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06060031
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           06070031
                 Else                                                   06080031
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    06090031
                   Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06100031
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06110031
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06120031
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           06130031
               End-If                                                   06140031
      *                                                                 06150031
             When other                                                 06160031
               Move  'E201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06170031
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06180031
      *                                                                 06190031
           End-Evaluate                                                 06200031
      *                                                                 06210031
           .                                                            06220031
      *################################################################.06230031
       F000-Select                       Section.                       06240031
      *                                                                 06250031
           Perform F100-Prepare-Qualification                           06260031
      *                                                                 06270031
      * We will first look through the storage, to see if we have       06280031
      * already got the wanted occurence.                               06290031
      *                                                                 06300031
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        06310031
      *                                                                 06320031
      * If we didn't find anything, we need to read. Then we store.     06330031
      *                                                                 06340031
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         06350031
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 06360031
               Perform F200-Select-Row                                  06370031
               Perform L100-Store-DCL                                   06380031
           End-If                                                       06390031
      *                                                                 06400031
      * At last we check what we've got to offer.                       06410031
      *                                                                 06420031
           Evaluate True                                                06430031
             When WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS)                                  06440031
               Move  WS-DB2-DCL (Ind-WS) To    DCLTF-Customer           06450031
               Perform J000-Get-Columns                                 06460031
      *                                                                 06470031
             When other                                                 06480031
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    06490031
               Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF-Q' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06500031
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06510031
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06520031
               Move  'VAR2'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (2)06530031
               Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID  To WD-Fin-Inst-ID              06540031
               Move  TFCU-Cust-NO        To WD-Customer-No              06550031
               String WD-Fin-Inst-ID           Delimited by size        06560031
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        06570031
                      WD-Customer-No           Delimited by space       06580031
                                       Into R7918030-In-Variable-Data(2)06590031
               End-String                                               06600031
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               06610031
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              06620031
                                         To    True                     06630031
      *                                                                 06640031
           End-Evaluate                                                 06650031
      *                                                                 06660031
           .                                                            06670031
