           .                                                            09900031
      *################################################################.09910031
       J100-Move-DCL-To-Output           Section.                       09920031
      *                                                                 09930031
      * PLEASE REMEMBER:                                                09940031
      *    When you modify the code in this section, you need to do     09950031
      *    the same modifications in module F115AMC0 - E500-section.    09960031
      *                                                                 09970031
           Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID      To    R115iCU0-Fin-Inst-ID     09980031
           Move  FK-KLID-Cust-ID         To    R115iCU0-Customer-ID     09990031
           Move  TFCU-Cust-No            To    R115iCU0-Customer-No     10000031
      *                                                                 10010031
           Move  TFCU-Bic-Bank           To    R115iCU0-Bic-Bank        10020031
           Move  TFCU-Bic-Countr         To    R115iCU0-Bic-Country     10030031
           Move  TFCU-Bic-Loct           To    R115iCU0-Bic-Location    10040031
           Move  TFCU-Bic-Branch         To    R115iCU0-Bic-Branch      10050031
      *                                                                 10060031
           Move  TFCU-Surname            To    R115iCU0-Surname         10070031
           Move  TFCU-ID-Surname         To    R115iCU0-ID-Surname      10080031
           Move  TFCU-First-Name         To    R115iCU0-Firstname       10090031
           Move  TFCU-Address-1          To    R115iCU0-Address-1       10100031
           Move  TFCU-Address-2          To    R115iCU0-Address-2       10110031
           Move  TFCU-Address-3          To    R115iCU0-Address-3       10120031
           Move  TFCU-Address-4          To    R115iCU0-Address-4       10130031
           Move  TFCU-Sector-Code        To    R115iCU0-Sector-Code     10140031
           Move  TFCU-Postal-Code        To    R115iCU0-Postal-Code     10150031
           Move  TFCU-Destination        To    R115iCU0-Destination     10160031
           Move  TFCU-Country-Code       To    R115iCU0-Country-Code    10170031
           Move  TFCU-Geo-Code           To    R115iCU0-Geo-Code        10180031
      *                                                                 10190031
           Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID      To    W-Fin-Inst-ID            10200031
           Perform N200-Fetch-Fin-Inst-No                               10210031
           Move  W-Fin-Inst-No           To    R115iCU0-Fin-Inst-No     10220031
      *                                                                 10230031
           Initialize                          R7919100-Konverter-Dato  10240031
           Set   R7919100-Versjon        To    True                     10250031
           Move  TFCU-Terminated         To    R7919100-In-Dato-DB2     10260031
           Set   R7919100-In-Konv-Til-AMD9                              10270031
                                         To    True                     10280031
           Call  'F7919100'              Using R7919100-Konverter-Dato  10290031
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      10300031
           End-Call                                                     10310031
           If  Not R7919999-Return-OK                                   10320031
               Move  'J101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       10330031
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       10340031
           End-If                                                       10350031
           Move  R7919100-Ut-Dato-AMD9   To    R115iCU0-Terminated-Date 10360031
      *                                                                 10370031
      * Info about the cursor:                                          10380031
      *                                                                 10390031
           Move  WC-Row-No               To  R115iCU0-Out-Row-No        10400031
           Move  WC-Total-No-Of-Rows     To  R115iCU0-Out-Total-Rows    10410031
      *                                                                 10420031
           .                                                            10430031
      *################################################################.10440031
       L100-Store-DCL                    Section.                       10450031
      *                                                                 10460031
      * We might already have this row in storage.                      10470031
      *                                                                 10480031
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        10490031
      *                                                                 10500031
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         10510031
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 10520031
             Then                                                       10530031
      *        If we have reached the end of the storage-table,         10540031
      *        we start on the beginning.                               10550031
      *        This way, we always keep the "newest" occurrences.       10560031
               Add   +1                  To    Ind-WS-Put               10570031
               If  Ind-WS-Put            >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         10580031
                   Move  +1              To    Ind-WS-Put               10590031
               End-If                                                   10600031
               Move  Ind-WS-Put          To    Ind-WS                   10610031
             Else                                                       10620031
               Move  Ind-WS              To    Ind-WS-Put               10630031
           End-If                                                       10640031
      *                                                                 10650031
      * We store the identification.                                    10660031
      *                                                                 10670031
           Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID      To    WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID       10680031
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)10690031
           Move  FK-KLID-Cust-ID         To    WS-DB2-Customer-ID       10700031
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)10710031
      *                                                                 10720031
      * The DCL is stored if found, the status is set.                  10730031
      *                                                                 10740031
           Evaluate True                                                10750031
             When Length                 Of    DCLTF-Customer           10760031
                > Length                 Of    WS-DB2-DCL               10770031
               Move  Length              Of    DCLTF-Customer           10780031
                                         To    WD-Length                10790031
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    10800031
               Move  'GL-WL-DCL-UTVIDES' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  10810031
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)10820031
               Move  WD-Length           To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)10830031
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               10840031
               Move  'L101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       10850031
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       10860031
      *                                                                 10870031
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 10880031
               Set   WS-DB2-Not-Found (Ind-WS-Put)                      10890031
                                         To    True                     10900031
      *                                                                 10910031
             When other                                                 10920031
               Move  DCLTF-Customer To         WS-DB2-DCL   (Ind-WS-Put)10930031
               Set   WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS-Put)                           10940031
                                         To    True                     10950031
      *                                                                 10960031
           End-Evaluate                                                 10970031
      *                                                                 10980031
           .                                                            10990031
      *################################################################.11000031
       L200-Find-DCL                     Section.                       11010031
      *                                                                 11020031
           Perform Varying Ind-WS                                       11030031
                   From  +1              By    +1                       11040031
                   Until Ind-WS          >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         11050031
                   or  ( WS-DB2-Customer-ID (Ind-WS)                    11060031
                                         =     FK-KLID-Cust-ID          11070031
                     and WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID (Ind-WS)                    11080031
                                         =     FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID)      11090031
           End-Perform                                                  11100031
      *                                                                 11110031
           .                                                            11120031
      *################################################################*11130031
       L300-Remove-DCL                   Section.                       11140031
      *                                                                 11150031
           Perform Varying Ind-WS                                       11160031
                   From  +1              By    +1                       11170031
                   Until Ind-WS          >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         11180031
                   or  ( WS-DB2-Customer-ID (Ind-WS)                    11190031
                                         =     FK-KLID-Cust-ID          11200031
                     and WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID (Ind-WS)                    11210031
                                         =     FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID )     11220031
           End-Perform                                                  11230031
      *                                                                 11240031
           Evaluate True                                                11250031
             When Ind-WS                 >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         11260031
               Continue                                                 11270031
      *                                                                 11280031
             When other                                                 11290031
               Initialize                      WS-DB2-Row (Ind-WS)      11300031
      *                                                                 11310031
           End-Evaluate                                                 11320031
      *                                                                 11330031
           .                                                            11340031
      *################################################################*11350031
       N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID            Section.                       11360031
      *                                                                 11370031
           Move  W-Fin-Inst-No (1:4)     To    W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         11380031
      *                                                                 11390031
           If  Not R5879010-Versjon                                     11400031
           or  R5879010-In-Konsernnr     Not = W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         11410031
      *                                                                 11420031
               Initialize                      R5879010-Konsern         11430031
               Set   R5879010-Versjon    To    True                     11440031
               Set   R5879010-In-Select  To    True                     11450031
               Move  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr    To    R5879010-In-Konsernnr    11460031
               Call  'F5879010'          Using R5879010-Konsern         11470031
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      11480031
               End-Call                                                 11490031
               If  Not R7919999-Return-OK                               11500031
                   Move  'N101'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       11510031
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   11520031
               End-If                                                   11530031
      *                                                                 11540031
           End-If                                                       11550031
      *                                                                 11560031
           Move  R5879010-Ut-KO-Konsern-Id                              11570031
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-ID            11580031
      *                                                                 11590031
           .                                                            11600031
      *################################################################*11610031
       N200-Fetch-Fin-Inst-No            Section.                       11620031
      *                                                                 11630031
           If  Not R5879010-Versjon                                     11640031
           or  R5879010-In-Konsern-ID    Not = W-Fin-Inst-ID            11650031
      *                                                                 11660031
               Initialize                      R5879010-Konsern         11670031
               Set   R5879010-Versjon    To    True                     11680031
               Set   R5879010-In-Select  To    True                     11690031
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    R5879010-In-Konsern-ID   11700031
               Call  'F5879010'          Using R5879010-Konsern         11710031
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      11720031
               End-Call                                                 11730031
               If  Not R7919999-Return-OK                               11740031
                   Move  'N201'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       11750031
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   11760031
               End-If                                                   11770031
      *                                                                 11780031
           End-If                                                       11790031
      *                                                                 11800031
           Move  R5879010-Ut-KO-Konsernnummer                           11810031
                                         To    W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         11820031
           Move  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr        To    W-Fin-Inst-No            11830031
      *                                                                 11840031
           .                                                            11850031
      *################################################################*11860031
       N300-Fetch-Customer-ID            Section.                       11870031
      *                                                                 11880031
           If  W-Fin-Inst-No             =     Space                    11890031
           and W-Fin-Inst-ID             Not = +0                       11900031
               Perform N200-Fetch-Fin-Inst-No                           11910031
           End-If                                                       11920031
      *                                                                 11930031
           Move  W-Fin-Inst-No (1:4)     To    W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         11940031
      *                                                                 11950031
           If  Not R1781910-Versjon                                     11960031
           or  R1781910-In-Konsern-Nr    Not = W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         11970031
           or  R1781910-In-Kunde-Nr      Not = W-Customer-No            11980031
      *                                                                 11990031
               Initialize                      R1781910-Kunde-ID        12000031
               Set   R1781910-Versjon    To    True                     12010031
               Set   R1781910-In-Select  To    True                     12020031
               Move  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr    To    R1781910-In-Konsern-Nr   12030031
               Move  W-Customer-No       To    R1781910-In-Kunde-Nr     12040031
               Call  'F1781910'          Using R1781910-Kunde-ID        12050031
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      12060031
               End-Call                                                 12070031
      *                                                                 12080031
               If  Not R7919999-Return-OK                               12090031
                   Move  'N301'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       12100031
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   12110031
               End-If                                                   12120031
      *                                                                 12130031
           End-If                                                       12140031
      *                                                                 12150031
           Move  R1781910-Ut-Kunde-ID    To    W-Customer-ID            12160031
      *                                                                 12170031
           .                                                            12180031
      *################################################################*12190031
       N400-Fetch-Customer-No            Section.                       12200031
      *                                                                 12210031
           If  Not R1781910-Versjon                                     12220031
           or  R1781910-In-Kunde-ID      Not = W-Customer-ID            12230031
      *                                                                 12240031
               Initialize                      R1781910-Kunde-ID        12250031
               Set   R1781910-Versjon    To    True                     12260031
               Set   R1781910-In-Select  To    True                     12270031
               Move  W-Customer-ID       To    R1781910-In-Kunde-ID     12280031
               Call  'F1781910'          Using R1781910-Kunde-ID        12290031
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      12300031
               End-Call                                                 12310031
      *                                                                 12320031
               If  Not R7919999-Return-OK                               12330031
                   Move  'N401'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       12340031
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   12350031
               End-If                                                   12360031
      *                                                                 12370031
           End-If                                                       12380031
      *                                                                 12390031
           Move  R1781910-Ut-Kunde-Nr    To    W-Customer-No            12400031
      *                                                                 12410031
           .                                                            12420031
      *################################################################*12430031
       N500-Navn-Intervall                Section.                      12440031
      *                                                                 12450031
           Perform With Test Before Until (Navn-Char(W-Ind) Not = Space 12460031
                                        and Low-Values or W-ind = 0)    12470031
              Move High-Value            To Navn-Char(W-Ind)            12480031
              Subtract 1                 From  W-Ind                    12490031
           End-Perform                                                  12500031
      *                                                                 12510031
           .                                                            12520031
      *################################################################*12530031
       ZI00-Conv-Input-Version           Section.                       12540031
      *                                                                 12550031
      * Version control.                                                12560031
      * If conversion is needed, we call the conversion module.         12570031
      *                                                                 12580031
           Set   R115iCU0-Version        To    True                     12590031
           Move  Length                  Of    R115iCU0-Customer        12600031
                                         To    W-IO-Length              12610031
      *                                                                 12620031
           Evaluate True                                                12630031
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115iCU0-Version-No      12640031
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            12650031
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              12660031
               Move  L-Ext-IO-Area (1:W-IO-Length)                      12670031
                                         To    W-Int-IO-Area            12680031
      *                                                                 12690031
             When Other                                                 12700031
               Call  'F115I999'                                         12710031
                   Using By Content      'F115ICU0 '                    12720031
                                         'INPUT '                       12730031
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  12740031
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  12750031
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            12760031
               End-Call                                                 12770031
      *                                                                 12780031
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                12790031
                   Move  'ZI03'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       12800031
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   12810031
               End-If                                                   12820031
      *                                                                 12830031
           End-Evaluate                                                 12840031
      *                                                                 12850031
           .                                                            12860031
      *################################################################*12870031
       ZO00-Conv-Output-Version          Section.                       12880031
      *                                                                 12890031
      * Version control.                                                12900031
      * If conversion is needed, we call the conversion module.         12910031
      *                                                                 12920031
           Evaluate True                                                12930031
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115iCU0-Version-No      12940031
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            12950031
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              12960031
               Move  W-Int-IO-Area       To    L-Ext-IO-Area            12970031
                                                         (1:W-IO-Length)12980031
      *                                                                 12990031
             When Other                                                 13000031
               Call  'F115I999'                                         13010031
                   Using By Content      'F115ICU0 '                    13020031
                                         'OUTPUT '                      13030031
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  13040031
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  13050031
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            13060031
               End-Call                                                 13070031
      *                                                                 13080031
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                13090031
                   Move  'ZO01'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       13100031
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   13110031
               End-If                                                   13120031
      *                                                                 13130031
           End-Evaluate                                                 13140031
      *                                                                 13150031
           .                                                            13160031
      *################################################################*13170031
       Z000-Error-Message                Section.                       13180031
      *                                                                 13190031
           Set   R7918030-Version        To    True                     13200031
      *                                                                 13210031
           Move  'TF'                    To    R7918030-In-System-ID    13220031
           Move  R115X000-Fin-Inst-No    To    R7918030-In-Fin-Inst-No  13230031
           Move  R115X000-FI-Language-639-1                             13240031
                                         To    R7918030-In-Language     13250031
           If  R115X000-Trace-On                                        13260031
               Set   R7918030-In-Log-Yes To    True                     13270031
           End-If                                                       13280031
      *                                                                 13290031
           Call  'F7918030'              Using R7918030-ErrorMessage    13300031
           End-Call                                                     13310031
      *                                                                 13320031
           Move  R7918030-Out-MessageText                               13330031
                                         To    R7919999-Message         13340031
      *                                                                 13350031
           .                                                            13360031
      *################################################################*13370031
       Z900-Abend                        Section.                       13380031
      *                                                                 13390031
           If  R7919999-Return-Code      Not   Numeric                  13400031
           or  Not R7919999-Return-Abend                                13410031
               Move  +0                  To    R7919999-Module-Ind      13420031
           End-If                                                       13430031
      *                                                                 13440031
           Add   +1                      To    R7919999-Module-Ind      13450031
      *                                                                 13460031
           If  R7919999-Module-Ind       Not >                          13470031
                             ( Length    Of    R7919999-Module-Tab      13480031
                             / Length    Of    R7919999-Module-Element )13490031
               Move  'F115ICU0'          To    R7919999-Module-Name     13500031
                                                   (R7919999-Module-Ind)13510031
               Move  R7919999-Paragraph  To    R7919999-Module-Para     13520031
                                                   (R7919999-Module-Ind)13530031
           End-If                                                       13540031
      *                                                                 13550031
           Set   R7919999-Return-Abend   To    TRUE                     13560031
      *                                                                 13570031
           Goback.                                                      13580031
